This project was developed by Paul Paradoxx / DARK ZERO RADIO
for use with AzuraCast, Liquidsoap and the laut.fm
START_AD_BREAK advertising trigger.

It is meant to help radio operators and DJs trigger the
laut.fm START_AD_BREAK automatically and correctly.

The code and the included START_AD_BREAK.mp3 may be used,
modified and shared free of charge.

